BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 548.52 Tm (proof of funds.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (The number-one deal killer after signing is a quality-of-earnings miss. SMB Law Group cites $2M of EBITDA) Tj ET
